From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 08:46:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] crun: check the generated JSON before using it

Add a package patch for crun's update: libcrun_container_update_from_values
ignores the status of json_gen_get_buf, which leaves the buffer unset
when json-c cannot allocate the document, and the indeterminate pointer
is parsed as the update's JSON. Fail the update instead, as crun's other
callers of json_gen_get_buf do.

Found reviewing the -O3 build's warnings of crun: 'buf' may be used
uninitialized (-Wmaybe-uninitialized).

Signed-off-by: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 utils/crun/Makefile                           |  2 +-
 ...k-the-generated-JSON-before-using-it.patch | 26 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 utils/crun/patches/100-update-check-the-generated-JSON-before-using-it.patch

diff --git a/utils/crun/Makefile b/utils/crun/Makefile
index 8ff34ec..62d41fa 100644
--- a/utils/crun/Makefile
+++ b/utils/crun/Makefile
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=crun
 PKG_VERSION:=1.28
-PKG_RELEASE:=1
+PKG_RELEASE:=2
 
 PKG_SOURCE:=$(PKG_NAME)-$(PKG_VERSION).tar.gz
 PKG_SOURCE_URL:=https://codeload.github.com/containers/crun/tar.gz/$(PKG_VERSION)?
diff --git a/utils/crun/patches/100-update-check-the-generated-JSON-before-using-it.patch b/utils/crun/patches/100-update-check-the-generated-JSON-before-using-it.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..06fe970
--- /dev/null
+++ b/utils/crun/patches/100-update-check-the-generated-JSON-before-using-it.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+From: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
+Subject: [PATCH] update: check the generated JSON before using it
+
+libcrun_container_update_from_values ignores the status of
+json_gen_get_buf, which leaves buf unset when json-c cannot allocate the
+document or its text. The indeterminate pointer then goes on to
+libcrun_container_update and parse_json_file. Fail the update instead,
+as the other callers of json_gen_get_buf do.
+
+Signed-off-by: kiritantakechi <kiritantakechi@gmail.com>
+---
+--- a/src/libcrun/container.c
++++ b/src/libcrun/container.c
+@@ -4296,7 +4296,11 @@ libcrun_container_update_from_values (li
+ 
+   json_gen_map_close (gen);
+ 
+-  json_gen_get_buf (gen, &buf, &buf_len);
++  if (UNLIKELY (json_gen_get_buf (gen, &buf, &buf_len) != json_gen_status_ok))
++    {
++      json_gen_free (gen);
++      return crun_make_error (err, 0, "json_gen_get_buf failed");
++    }
+ 
+   ret = libcrun_container_update (context, id, buf, buf_len, err);
+ 
